OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud and some clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAfter a cloudy start all parts
OL,12,Fwill have a dry day with some good
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine. Feeling warm, but
OL,14,Fa cooler onshore breeze along the east
OL,15,Fcoast.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FCloudier on Tuesday with a chance of
OL,19,Fshowers. Some longer spells of rain
OL,20,Fare likely to extend north at times on
OL,21,FWednesday and Thursday.
